<<<
Where only three years ago was pasture land now stands vast engineering shops, miles of railway sidings, & the constant hum of machinery.
===
*Where only three years ago* was *pasture land now* stands *vast engineering* shops, miles *of railway sidings,* & *the constant* hum *of machinery.*
>>>

<<<
the influence of these no doubt accounts for are: The Thames has certain natural disadvantages as a shipbuilding centre; to these are added an artificial disadvantage.
